CLINICAL GUIDELINES ATTRIBUTION:

This software incorporates clinical guidelines and protocols from:

- CAP (College of American Pathologists) - Cancer Protocol Templates
  © College of American Pathologists. Used with permission for educational
  and quality assurance purposes.

- ICCR (International Collaboration on Cancer Reporting) - Cancer Datasets
  © International Collaboration on Cancer Reporting. Used for educational
  and quality assurance purposes.

- AJCC (American Joint Committee on Cancer) - TNM Staging Manual 8th Edition
  © American Joint Committee on Cancer. Staging information used for
  educational purposes.

- AAPA (American Association of Pathology Assistants) - Macroscopic
  Examination Guidelines
  © American Association of Pathology Assistants. Used for educational
  purposes.

- WHO (World Health Organization) - Classification of Tumours 5th Edition
  © World Health Organization. Classification information used for
  educational purposes.

Users of this software are responsible for ensuring compliance with all
applicable guidelines and obtaining necessary permissions for clinical use.

